    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30442" root="علو" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُسْتَعْلًى</span></b>  The <i>near,</i> i. e. <i>left, side</i> of a she-camel:
you say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَتَيْتُ النَّاقَةَ مِنع قِبَلِ مُسْتَعْلَاهَا</span> i. e. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِنْ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قِبَلِ إِنْسِيِّهَا</span> [<i>I came to the she-camel from the
direction of her near,</i> or <i>left, side</i>]. (TA.)

